Lima?

367
00:34:15.762 --> 00:34:16.763
Sang-yeon!

368
00:34:18.222 --> 00:34:19.307
Cheon Sang Yeon!

369
00:34:27.273 --> 00:34:28.816
<i>Saya baru mengetahuinya nanti…</i>

370
00:34:32.862 --> 00:34:34.238
<i>apa Sang-hak </i>seonbae…

371
00:34:36.616 --> 00:34:38.659
<i>benar-benar dimaksudkan untuk Sang-yeon.</i>

372
00:34:59.222 --> 00:35:01.641
Itu di lantai tiga.
Saya akan melihat tampilannya.

373
00:35:01.724 --> 00:35:02.558
Tentu.

